      "file": "build\\mom_voice_older\\apartment_1988\\m1.mp3",
      "node": "m1",
      "text": "Cassie, it's Mom. Happy Fourth. The fireworks have the cat under the stove again.",
      "runtime_sha256": "03057e89b0771bd30ffc1db4748351bd338bd5f0fd4069bbe079d3f6b633e3c4"
    },
    {
      "bytes": 120834.0,
      "dialogue": "apartment_1988",
      "duration": 7.47682523727417,
      "file": "build\\mom_voice_older\\apartment_1988\\m2.mp3",
      "node": "m2",
      "text": "I bought a cake. I know. I know it's silly. He'd be twenty-six today... Anyway. Call me back, sweetheart.",
      "runtime_sha256": "6cd4fbeed77b2d5065604f3271870d5ffe40198cd3d1dbcee2d26bff8ecc214e"
    },
    {
      "bytes": 140060.0,
      "dialogue": "call_m02",
      "duration": 8.68426322937012,
      "file": "build\\mom_voice_older\\call_m02\\a.mp3",
      "node": "a",
      "text": "Cassie? It's Mom. I know it's late. A man called about Tommy's car. Arlo something. He says he still has it.",
      "runtime_sha256": "ef2811fb492d4083902fdf36dadfcf0099d41e5840157b12a790793b72578583"
    },
    {
      "bytes": 75276.0,
      "dialogue": "call_m02",
      "duration": 4.64399099349976,
      "file": "build\\mom_voice_older\\call_m02\\b.mp3",
      "node": "b",
      "text": "He said you'd come for it tonight. Out in Yermo? At two in the morning?",
      "runtime_sha256": "019db315960de2bab3423535937dd446701c07320bb168db7dcba90d25982ba7"
    },
    {
      "bytes": 119162.0,
      "dialogue": "call_m02",
      "duration": 7.38394546508789,
      "file": "build\\mom_voice_older\\call_m02\\d.mp3",
      "node": "d",
      "text": "Bring me something of his. Anything. ...And be nice to the dogs. You know how you get with dogs.",
      "runtime_sha256": "ac24eadfa0ddcffb5972178133a1553df9d791ddb84dd234bea147fce0302333"
    }
  ],
